 ### [ChunkMesh Vertex Packing and Management](3566-chunkmesh-vertex-packing-and-management.md)
-A dynamic mesh generation and update technique for voxel terrain that combines face culling with compact vertex storage and incremental buffer updates. It solves the problem of high memory overhead and frequent GPU buffer uploads in voxel worlds by packing vertex attributes into two 32-bit integers and reusing vertex slots via a free-list allocator. Unlike static meshing methods, it supports incremental addition and removal of blocks, updating only the affected faces and their neighbors.
